===============================================================================

Not covered by the MIT License: the characters (all rights reserved)

"The Software" in the MIT License above does not include the items below.
All rights in them are reserved by their right holders, and they are not
licensed for reuse. You may look at them, and use them unchanged inside this
app to try it out. You may not copy, modify, redistribute or otherwise reuse
them, in whole or in part, outside that.

  1. Everything in the characters/ folder: the models, motions, 2D parts,
     pictures, character.json files and personality texts of Norrie (ノリー)
     and of the other sample characters.
  2. Everything in the creator/samples/ folder: the sample characters'
     pictures, settings and comparison pictures.
  3. Files made for one particular character, which reproduce it:
     creator/builders/<id>.py, creator/specs/<id>_*, creator/draw/gen_<id>.py
     and creator/d2/from_drawing/<id>_*.py, where <id> is one of norrie,
     yokoso, robo, f_led, d_lantern, mikan, kumomaru and pokotake. This
     also covers the rig settings made for one character, such as
     creator/builders/norrie_rig_c.json (Norrie's rig settings, version C).
  4. The characters themselves (their looks, names and personalities),
     wherever they appear in this repository, for example in tests, skills,
     documents and pictures.
  5. Norrie's design. A collaborator drew Norrie by hand (front, side and
     back) during the hackathon and let us use the drawing for this work.
     The drawing itself is not stored in this repository.

To make a character of your own, use the code with your own words or your own
picture (README.en.md, "Make your own character on your PC with Claude Code").

===============================================================================

日本語の要約

- コード: MIT ライセンス(上の英語の本文)。
- キャラ: MIT ライセンスに含みません。権利はすべて権利を持つ人に残り、再利用を
  許可しません。見ることと、このアプリの中でそのまま試すことだけができます。
  含まない物: characters/ の全部・creator/samples/ の全部・1 体のキャラのために
  作った作り方のファイル(上の 3。ノリーの骨の設定 creator/builders/norrie_rig_c.json
  も含む)・キャラそのもの(見た目・名前・性格)・
  ノリーの絵(協力者がハッカソンの期間中に手で描き、この作品に使うことを許して
  くれた物。絵そのものは、このリポジトリに入れていません)。
- 自分のキャラは、コードを使って、自分の言葉か自分の絵から作ってください
  (README.md の「自分の PC で、Claude Code と自分のキャラを作る」)。
- 使っている部品は、それぞれのライセンスのままです(THIRD_PARTY.md)。
